OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening with the odd sunny spell
OL,7,Finitially. A band of rain arriving
OL,8,Fthrough the late evening and crossing
OL,9,Fthe region overnight. clearing to
OL,10,Fshowers by dawn. Breezy initially but
OL,11,Fwinds easing overnight. Feeling less
OL,12,Fmild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,15,Fscattered showers. Showers may turn
OL,16,Fheavy at times with a risk of hail and
OL,17,Fthunder. Light winds freshening
OL,18,Fthrough the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
